      "text": {
        "html": "<div class=\"course-rich-text\"><p data-w-id=\"579e5546-01af-36ee-8cfa-c5a4358fd465\">The course is <a href=\"https://slobodskyi.com/ua/courses/onlyfans\" data-w-id=\"4b913716-d5f5-8e04-82c2-dd26637fc6ac\">currently available in Ukrainian</a> and will soon be offered in English.</p><p data-w-id=\"5fba17d2-77cb-f9f3-47eb-d80668a7fb47\">If you want to know when it will be released, you can <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/slobodskyi\" target=\"_blank\" data-w-id=\"2eba4b48-d367-bf69-13c8-5fc6e48de75f\">subscribe on Instagram</a>.</p></div>",
